"\n"
"<smallcaps>Folia Asteroids have plenty of organic material but Duplicants will have to venture outside their starting biome quickly to find any metal.</smallcaps>"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.FORESTMOONLET.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.FORESTMOONLET.NAME"
msgid "Folia Asteroid"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.HELICONA.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.HELICONA.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Due to its highly elliptical orbit around its host star, this rock is cold. Oh so very cold.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps></smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
