msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.MINIBADLANDS.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A barren location with an overabundance of mineral resources and oil.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>The rocky terrain of The Desolands poses no immediate threats, but the limited variety of resources will make expansion and technological progress challenging.</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
