"An irradiated world with renewable water sources.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>Both the radioactive biome and the ocean biome present unique challenges yet considerable payoffs.</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.MINIRADIOACTIVEOCEAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.MINIRADIOACTIVEOCEAN.NAME"
