"A small, snow-laden world rich with oil and nectar resources.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>Sub-zero temperatures pose unique challenges but the potential for power production is very valuable.</smallcaps>"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.MINISHATTEREDWARP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.MINISHATTEREDWARP.NAME"
msgid "Sweet Ceres Asteroid"
msgstr ""

